        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Dynamics</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Ergodic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">MeasurePreserving</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Homeo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Submonoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">carrier</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeasurePreserving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">one_mem'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeasurePreserving</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_mem'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ψ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hϕ1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hψ1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hϕ1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">comp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hψ1</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The fancy import is just for <code>MeasurePreserving</code>. Neither <code>by exact</code> can be removed. Is the issue the <code>:= by volume_tac</code> in <code>MeasurePreserving</code>?</p>",
        "id": 599636880,
